sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Writer (UI)
    participant Bridge as ember-bridge
    participant Store as Local Store
    participant Ember as Ember Runtime (llama.cpp)
    User->>UI: "Summarise this document"
    UI->>Bridge: request(summarise, doc_id, effort=Balanced)
    Bridge->>Store: retrieve doc + local RAG context
    Store-->>Bridge: plaintext (in-memory, never leaves device)
    Bridge->>Ember: prompt + context (selected model tier)
    Ember-->>Bridge: completion (streamed tokens)
    Bridge-->>UI: streamed summary
    UI-->>User: summary inline; "ran on your device"
